@baseUrl = https://localhost:7226

### Fetch a request token after authenticating with the existing account workflow.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/csrf

### Staff table
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments?page=1&pageSize=20&search=Ana&status=1

### Tariff history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/prices

### Staff coverage summary and potential renewals (not debt or revenue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/summary

### GymAdmin collections by inclusive paid-on dates, with voids separate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/collections?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### Same-day collections; both dates are required, maximum 366 inclusive days
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/collections?from=2026-11-15&to=2026-11-15

### Initial tariff (replace request token with the same-session value)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/prices
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amountCents":100099,"initialEffectiveFrom":"2026-11-01"}

### Preview a manual payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/students/1/preview
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"paidOn":"2026-11-15","method":1}

### Confirm the exact preview; retain this body for identical retries
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/students/1
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"paidOn":"2026-11-15","method":1,"previewToken":"{{previewToken}}","idempotencyKey":"example-payment-1"}

### Staff history (foreign or missing ficha returns 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/students/1?page=1&pageSize=20

### Latest-only administrative correction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/students/1/1/void
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Correction of accidental registration"}

### Own explicitly linked ficha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/me/profile

### Own live coverage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/me/coverage

### Own history without internal audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student/me/payments?page=1&pageSize=20
